  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Correct order of ionisation energy will be : Na &lt; Al &lt; Mg &lt; Si.</p><p>On going from left to right in periodic table effective nuclear charge increases due to which ionisation energy increases. But there is exception in order of Al and Mg, in case of Mg electron is removed from fulfilled&nbsp;&#39;s&#39; subshell due to which it has higher I.E.</p>"
